OL,3,GNEWSAMan in 70s dies in light aircraft
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 70s has died in a light
OL,7,Faircraft crash near Guildford.
OL,9,FSurrey Police said the man - who was
OL,10,Fpiloting the aircraft - was pronounced
OL,11,Fdead on the scene, following the crash
OL,12,Fin a field in Worplesdon shortly after
OL,13,F15:30 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FThe force said there was a "large
OL,16,Femergency services" response in the
OL,17,Farea, close to Worplesdon Road.
OL,19,FThis involved firefighters and
OL,20,Fambulance crews, it added.
